ance. The new margin is inked in blue. Old margin is inked\u000ain black. The specimen is entirely submitted for histologic evaluation.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  medial shave margin, multi frags, ESS.\u000aPart two is received designated "right breast tissue, inferior shave margin".\u000aThe specimen consists of a single portion of fibroadipose tissue that measures\u000a7 x REMOVED_DATE x 2 cm. There is a single stitch designating the new margin which is\u000ayellow to pink and the opposite space is pink to tan and fibrous and rubbery\u000aconsistent with old margin. New margin is inked in blue. Old margin is inked\u000ain black. The specimen is entirely submitted for histologic evaluation.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  inferior shave margin, multi frags, ESS.\u000arfi\u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: SURGICAL MARGIN\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SURGICAL MARGIN\u000a[report_end]
