ler portion of tissue which is REMOVED_DATE x\u000a2.2 x REMOVED_DATE cm. Its outer surfaces are inked throughout, and the specimen is\u000across sectioned and serially submitted in REMOVED_DATE  24 agg. all.\u000aDictated by: DDK____(signature on file)____DENNIS J. FEEN, M.D. REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a____(signature on file)____DANIEL D. KOELLIKER, M.D. REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a[report_end]
