ior = black; anterior = blue; superior = red; inferior =\u000agreen; lateral = yellow; medial = orange. The specimen is entirely submitted\u000afrom lateral to medial.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  left breast tissue, multi frags, ESS.\u000afm\u000aReports to: IGLEHART, JAMES, DIRK M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
