E cm, located REMOVED_DATE cm deep of the skin ellipse and\u000aextending REMOVED_DATE cm of the inferior, REMOVED_DATE cm of the lateral, REMOVED_DATE cm of the\u000asuperior, REMOVED_DATE cm of the posterior and REMOVED_DATE cm of the medial resection margin.\u000aRepresentative sections including margins are submitted. There are no further\u000afocal lesions identified and the specimen consists of 70% of yellow adipose\u000atissue.\u000aMicro 1: medial resection margin, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 2: mass with inferior resection margin, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 3: inferior resection margin, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aMicro 4: area of fibrosis, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aMicro 5: inferior resection margin, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aMicros REMOVED_DATE  superior resection margin, 3 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 9: posterior resection margin, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aMicro 10: superior/inferior margin, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aMicro 11: medial margin, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 12: skin with scar, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aMicro 13: posterior a margin, 1 frag, RSS.\u000atb\u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
