eviewed and reveals an ill-defined density and a\u000alocalization wire.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  right breast tissue, mult frags, ESS\u000adl\u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
