ass or DCIS is identified. All of the fibrous tissue is\u000asubmitted.\u000aMicro 1: inferior margin, multi frag, RSS\u000aMicro 2: superior margin, 2 frag, RSS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  posterior margin, 1 frag/cass, RSS\u000aMicro 5: anterior/skin margin, 2 frag, RSS\u000aMicro 6: lateral margin, 2 frag, RSS\u000aMicro 7: medial margin, 2 frag, RSS\u000aMicro 8: section of core site with clip, 1 frag, RSS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  remainder of fibrous tissue, REMOVED_DATE frag/cass, ESS\u000adam\u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
