osest medial margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the closest lateral margin, and REMOVED_DATE cm from\u000athe closest anterior margin. The clip was located in the center of the\u000acalcified lesion. Serial sectioning reveals that this specimen is 95% adipose\u000atissue with 5% pink-tan strands of fibrous tissue. A discrete mass is not\u000agrossly identified. The entire specimen is submitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  breast tissue, 4 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  inferior and lateral margins, perpendicular, multi frags, ESS.\u000ahph\u000aReports to: LESNIKOSKI, BETH-ANN M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
