ED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm in\u000aaggregate). Second yellow cassette "B" contains multiple pink/tan soft tissues\u000a(2.0 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm in aggregate).\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Yellow cassette A contents (CA++), multi frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Yellow cassette B contents, multi frags, ESS.\u000aLM/mmm\u000aCASE NUMBER: BS-08-REMOVED_CASE_ID\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Jane E. Brock M.B., B.S., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000a7/3/2008\u000a[report_end]
