ED_DATE cm of medial margin. The specimen is submitted as follows: H: Lateral margin, en face I: Superior margin J: Inferior margin K-M: Tumor to anterior and posterior margin N: Medial margin, en face Received fresh, labeled with the patient's name, unit number and "final shavings, right breast margins at 9 o'clock" are multiple tan-yellow fibrofatty tissue fragments, aggregating to 4 x 3 x REMOVED_DATE cm, entirely submitted in cassettes O-P. Gross Description by: TAI-YUAN LIN, MD Resident: QUN DONG, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT - REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID REPORTS TO: Barbara Lynn Smith, M.D. PART A: BREAST (RIGHT SUB-AREOLAR), EXCISION PART B: LYMPH NODE (RIGHT AXILLA, SENTINEL), EXCISION PART C: BREAST (RIGHT,9 O'CLOCK), EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART D: BREAST (RIGHT, "FINAL SHAVE 9:00"), EXCISIONAL BIO
