ior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the\u000ainferior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the superior margin, and REMOVED_DATE cm from the medial\u000amargin. The remainder of the breast parenchyma is unremarkable adipose tissue\u000aadmixed with firm, fibrous tissue. The entire specimen is submitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  superior margin: 3 frags, ESS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  lateral, medial, anterior, posterior margins, to include nodular\u000aarea in Micro 5: 7 frags, ESS\u000aMicro 10, medial and inferior margins: 1 frag, ESS\u000aMicro 11, inferior and anterior margins: 1 frag, ESS\u000aMicro 12, medial margin: 2 frags, ESS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  inferior margin: 6 frags, ESS\u000ajgi/\u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
