 tissue. Adjacent\u000ato the area, there is a small focus of hemorrhage. This area is REMOVED_DATE cm from\u000athe inferior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the superior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the\u000aposterior margin and REMOVED_DATE cm from the anterior margin. The lateral margin is 2\u000acm away and the medial margin is REMOVED_DATE cm away. Representative sections are\u000asubmitted for histologic evaluation. The specimen is 50% fibrous tissue and\u000a50% fat.\u000aMicro 1: lateral margin, 4 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  area closest to clip, 14 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  additional areas of the specimen, 12 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 17: lateral margin, 3 frags, RSS.\u000amir\u000aReports to: SHOJI, BRENT, T. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
