e not been cleared or approved by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA). The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary; this laboratory has established and verified the test's accuracy and precision. Added by: Atul Kumar Bhan, M.D. Signed On: 04 AUG 00 at 16:39 Consulting Pathologist(s): Grace T. McKee,MD *** SPECIAL STAINS Addendum *** LYMPH NODE (RIGHT BREAST SENTINEL), EXCISION ONE CLUSTER OF CYTOKERATIN-POSITIVE CELLS PRESENT IN REMOVED_DATE NODES. Added by: Grace T. McKee,MD Signed On: 07 AUG 00 at 08:15 GROSS DESCRIPTION: Received fresh, labeled with the patient's name and unit number, and "sentinel node right breast" is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm fat tissue which is dissected to show two nodes measuring REMOVED_DATE and REMOVED_DATE cm in greatest diameter. Both nodes are submitted in cassette A. Received fresh, labeled with the patient's name and unit number, and "final shaved margin" are multiple fatty tissues aggregating REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm which is inked black and sectioned to show 95% fat and 5% fibrous tissue and submitted entirely in cassettes B-F. Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab, labeled with the patient's name and unit number, and "right breast mass" is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm segment of breast tissue which is designated with long sutures at lateral margin, and short suture at superior margin. The specimen is inked as posterior in black, anterior/superior in blue and anterior/inferior in green. Sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm tumor which is REMOVED_DATE cm from the lateral margin and REMOVED_DATE cm from the medial inferior/posterior margin. Representative sections are as follows: G-I: tumor with posterior and inferior margins J-K: inferior margin L: representative of remaining tissue. Resident: AQING CHEN, MD *** INTRA-OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS *** GROSS DIAGNOSIS: REMOVED_DATE X REMOVED_DATE X REMOVED_DATE CM TUMOR AT REMOVED_DATE CM FROM LATERAL MARGIN AND REMOVED_DATE CM FROM MID POSTERIOR-INFERIOR MARGIN. O.R. Resident: SOUHAD YOUNES, MD O.R. Diagnosis by: CHIN-LEE WU, MD, PhD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: MGH-OUTPATIENT (OFF.P/CLINIC) REPORTS TO: Barbara Lynn Smith, M.D. PART A: LYMPH NODE (RIGHT BREAST SENTINAL), EXCISION PART B: BREAST (RIGHT SHAVED MARGIN), EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART C: BREAST(RIGHT),EXCISIONAL BIOPSY
