aaccording to the accompanying pathology report bearing the patient's name.\u000aTwo (2) cytology slides are labeled "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", corresponding to a right\u000abreast fine needle aspiration performed on REMOVED_DATE  according to the\u000aaccompanying cytology report bearing the patient's name. These slides will be\u000asent to the Cytology Division for review.\u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: OUTSIDE SLIDE CONSULT - BREAST\u000a[report_end]
