ectioned and\u000aentirely submitted for histologic analysis.\u000aMicro 1: anterior (skin ellipse), medial skin tip, 1 frag, ESS\u000aMicro 2: anterior (skin ellipse), lateral tip, 1 frag, ESS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  remainder of anterior (skin ellipse), serially sectioned, 12\u000afrags, ESS\u000aMicro 5: posterior, serially sectioned, 7 frags, ESS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  remainder of mass, anterior to posterior (clip in micro 10), 12\u000afrags, ESS\u000afsd\u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
