ltiple, soft, fragmented, yellow to white tissue cores (1 x 1 x REMOVED_DATE cm in\u000adiameter, each).\u000aMicro 3: multi frags, ESS.\u000artv\u000aReports to: SMITH, DARRELL, NOLAN M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES)\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES)\u000a[report_end]
