led in the remaining cassettes.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  nodule and adjacent breast parenchyma, multiple fragments, RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  breast parenchyma, multiple fragments, RSS.\u000aReports to: OSTEEN, ROBERT, T. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
