hree, labeled "right breast tissue medial/inferior margin", consists of a\u000asingle fragment of pink/yellow fibroadipose tissue (6.0 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm) and is\u000aoriented with three sutures (short=medial, long=anterior and whipstitch=new\u000amargin). The specimen is inked as follows: anterior=blue, posterior=green,\u000amedial=orange, lateral=yellow, superior=red, and inferior=black. Serial\u000asections reveal adipose tissue with no nodules or masses. The specimen is\u000aentirely submitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  medial/inferior shave margin, REMOVED_DATE frags each, ESS\u000ardr\u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: LYMPH NODE BIOPSY\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SURGICAL MARGIN\u000a[report_end]
