VAccession Number: REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID:REMOVED_CASE_ID Report Status: Signed\u000aType: Surgical Pathology\u000aProcedure Date: REMOVED_DATE \u000aDIAGNOSIS:\u000aA. Left breast, re-excision:\u000aResidual infiltrating duct carcinoma, poorly differentiated, REMOVED_DATE cm., see\u000asynoptic.\u000aDuctal carcinoma in situ, high grade, solid, clinging and cribriform\u000atypes, see synoptic.\u000aPrior healing surgical site changes.\u000aSkin with scar.\u000aB. Left breast, "final superior breast", excision:\u000aBreast tissue with no diagnostic abnormalities recognized; no tumor seen.\u000aC. Left breast, "final medial breast", excision:\u000aFew foci of ductal carcinoma in situ, see synoptic.\u000aD. Left breast, "final deep breast", excision:\u000aDuctal carcinoma in situ, see synoptic.\u000aPrior biopsy site changes.\u000aE. Left breast, "final inferior breast", excision:\u000aDuctal carcinoma in situ, see synoptic.\u000aF. Left breast, "final lateral breast", excision:\u000aDuctal carcinoma in situ, see synoptic.\u000aPrior biopsy site changes.\u000aSYNOPTIC REPORT: BREAST\u000aINVASIVE TUMOR:\u000a-histologic type: ductal\u000a-histologic grade: poorly differentiated\u000a-size (greatest dimension): REMOVED_DATE cm.\u000a-lymphatic/vascular invasion: none identified\u000a-perineural invasion: none identified\u000a-microcalcification: none identified\u000a-margins for invasive tumor: One small focus of invasive tumor is less than\u000a0.1 cm. from the margin at the inferior-deep\u000ajunction in specimen A. No invasive tumor is\u000aseen in specimens B-F.\u000a-immunohistochemical staining on prior specimen (S-06-2064) was reported as:\u000aEstrogen receptor: NEGATIVE\u000aProgesterone receptor: NEGATIVE\u000aREMOVED_ACCESSION_ID/neu (c-erb-REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID): NEGATIVE for overexpression\u000aDUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU (DCIS):\u000a-histologic type: solid, clinging and cribriform\u000a-histologic grade: high\u000a-size (greatest dimension): REMOVED_DATE cm. in the main specimen (A). Scattered\u000asmall foci of ductal carcinoma in situ are\u000aseen in specimens C-F.\u000a-extent: multifocal\u000a-extensive intraductal component: absent\u000a-necrosis in DCIS: present, very focal\u000a-microcalcifications in DCIS: none identified\u000a-margins for DCIS: In the main specimen (A), ductal carcinoma\u000ain situ is less than REMOVED_DATE cm. from the\u000amedial and superior margins and less than\u000a0.1 from the junction of the superior-deep\u000aand inferior-deep margins. In specimens\u000aC-F, the ductal carcinoma in situ is less\u000athan REMOVED_DATE cm. from the new inked "true"\u000amargins designated with the\u000asutures.\u000aPRIOR RELATED SPECIMENS REVIEWED:\u000asite: left breast specimen #: S-06-2064 date: REMOVED_DATE \u000aThe pTNM staging remains the same as reported on the prior specimen S-06-2064.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by: Nicole A. Mihok, M.D.\u000aClinical diagnosis & history:\u000aInfiltrating duct carcinoma and ductal carcinoma in situ of left breast\u000aTissue-Designation:\u000aA.Breast, excision with margins - left\u000aB.Breast, excision with margins - left, final superior breast\u000aC.Breast, excision with margins - left, final medial breast\u000aD.Breast, excision with margins - left, final deep breast\u000aE.Breast, excision with margins - left, final inferior breast\u000aF.Breast, excision with margins - left final lateral breast\u000aGross description:\u000aThe specimen is received in six containers.\u000aSpecimen A labeled "left breast" consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm. mass of\u000abreast tissue with a very thin ellipse of skin on the surface. The ellipse\u000ameasures REMOVED_DATE cm. in length and is up to REMOVED_DATE cm. in greatest diameter. There\u000aare two stitches. The long stitch is lateral and the short stitch is superior.\u000aThe ellipse of skin is slightly lateral. The superior half of the specimen is\u000ainked blue; the inferior half, green; the deep margin, black. It is then\u000asectioned from medial towards lateral. The cut surface shows yellowish-white\u000astreaks throughout the breast tissue and a slightly firmish, white area towards\u000athe center. It is entirely submitted from medial in cassette REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID to lateral in\u000acassette REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID. 6X all.\u000aSpecimen B labeled "left final superior breast" consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE \u000acm. portion of breast tissue with a stitch designating the new margin. This\u000anew margin surface is inked black. The other surfaces are not inked. The\u000aspecimen is sectioned and submitted entirely in cassette B. 3X all.\u000aSpecimen C is labeled "left final medial breast". It has a stitch designating\u000athe new margin. It consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm. portion of breast tissue.\u000aThe stitched surface is inked black. The other surfaces are not inked. The\u000aspecimen is sectioned and entirely submitted in cassettes REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID. 2 agg. all.\u000aSpecimen D labeled "left final deep breast" consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm.\u000aportion of breast tissue with a stitch marking the new true margin. This\u000asurface is inked black. The other surfaces are not inked. It is serially\u000asectioned and entirely submitted in cassettes REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID. 3 agg. all.\u000aSpecimen E labeled "left final inferior breast" consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE \u000acm. portion of breast tissue with a stitch on one edge marking the new margin.\u000aThis surface is inked. The other surfaces are not inked. It is sectioned and\u000aentirely submitted in cassette E. 1 agg. all.\u000aSpecimen F labeled "left final lateral breast" consists of a portion of breast\u000atissue with a suture marking the new margin. The specimen measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x\u000a1.3 cm. The surface with the suture is inked black. The other surfaces are\u000anot inked. The specimen is sectioned and entirely submitted in cassettes\u000aREMOVED_ACCESSION_ID. 2 agg. all.\u000aDictated by: NAM____(signature on file)____RICHARD SAMPSON, M.D. REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a____(signature on file)____NICOLE MIHOK, M.D. REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a[report_end]
