eal\u000awhite/tan, firm, lobulated tissue with a focal, rubber-like, more solid area\u000a(0.8 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm). This area is located approximately REMOVED_DATE cm from the\u000aanterior margin and at least 2 cm from other margins. In addition, on the\u000alateral/anterior corner, there is an attached possible adipose fibrous tissue\u000awhich measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm and is yellow/white/tan. No necrotic or\u000ahemorrhagic areas are identified. Representative sections are submitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  representative sections from the breast mass,\u000aMicro 10&11 contain the more solid area which is close to the anterior margin.\u000a1 fragment for each cassettes, RSS.\u000aMicro 12: possible adipose fibrous tissue, 2 frags, RSS.\u000amjy\u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
