le with closest superior, anterior, posterior and inferior\u000amargins, 1 frag each, ESS.\u000aMicro 6: closest lateral margin, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 7: closest medial margin, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 8: representative section of breast tissue, 1 frag, RSS.\u000afm\u000aReports to: CARTER, KATHARINE M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
