rea of fibrosis with inferior, superior margins, 1 frag each\u000acassestte, ESS.\u000aMicro 18: anterior and posterior margin, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 19: medial and lateral margins, 3 frags, RSS.\u000ageb\u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: SENTINEL LYMPH NODE\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SURGICAL MARGIN\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SURGICAL MARGIN\u000a[report_end]
