 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  lateral margin, 4 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  superior and inferior margin, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 7: most superior and inferior margin, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aMicro 8: anterior skin margin, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 9: anterior margin, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  medial margin, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  another area of hemorrhage with inferior and superior margins,\u000a2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  more medial margin, 4 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 16: anterior margin closest to hemorrhagic, 1 frag, RSS.\u000ajis\u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
