lly sectioned to\u000areveal a 60% yellow lobulated fatty to 40% dense white fibrous tissue with\u000aprominent fibrocystic disease, with the largest cyst measuring REMOVED_DATE cm in\u000agreatest dimension. Representative sections are submitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  left breast tissue, to include overlying skin, 2 frags each, RSS\u000aMicro 5: entire largest cyst, 2 frags, ESS\u000alm\u000aReports to: HERGRUETER, CHARLES, A. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST REDUCTION MAMMOPLASTY\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST REDUCTION MAMMOPLASTY\u000a[report_end]
