 portion of soft tissue. The specimen is entirely submitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  posterior portion of specimen from medial to lateral, 9 frags,\u000aESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  central portion of specimen, trisected, submitted medial to\u000alateral, 1 frag each, ESS.\u000a(Micro 6 includes a portion of the nodule).\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  anterior portion of specimen, submitted medial to lateral,\u000anodules submitted in micro 9 and 10, 2 frags each, ESS.\u000aMicro 13: additional fragments of tissue in container.\u000aReports to: MATORY, YVEDT, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
