/black; anterior/blue; superior/red; inferior/green;\u000alateral/yellow; medial/orange. There is also a wire in place through the\u000acenter of the specimen. The cut surface consists of tan/white fibrous tissue\u000awith no discrete lesions identified.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Right breast tissue, REMOVED_DATE frags in each, ESS.\u000aESN/mmm\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Jonathan N Glickman M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000a6/19/2006\u000a[report_end]
