y 80% fibrous tissue and 20% fatty\u000atissue. Approximately 95% of the specimen is submitted for microscopic\u000aexamination.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  inferior and lateral margins, perpendicular, 6 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  sections through body including superior, inferior, anterior and\u000aposterior margins, multi frags, RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  medial margin, perpendicular, multi frags, RSS.\u000arlr\u000aReports to: SHOJI, BRENT, T. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
