ss sections to include mass, block REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID to include\u000abiopsy cavity and metallic clip, 1 frag each, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Opposite long axis perpendicular sections, 2 frags, ESS.\u000aCASE NUMBER: REMOVED_CASE_ID\u000asek/lp\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Lucian R Chirieac M.D., Electronically signed on Sunday\u000aFebruary 15, 2009 at 03:41:41PM\u000a[report_end]
