 lesion. The specimen is entirely\u000asubmitted for histologic examination.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  right breast mass, 6 frags, ESS\u000arfi\u000aReports to: KAELIN, CAROLYN, MARY, M.PH. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
