n,\u000a0.8 cm from the superior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the inferior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from\u000athe lateral margin.\u000aMicro #1: Medial margin to tumor, multiple frags, ESS.\u000aMicro #2: Tumor to superior, anterior, and posterior margins, 1 frag, ESS.\u000aMicro #3: Inferior margin to tumor, 1 frag, ESS.\u000aMicro #4: Tumor to posterior, anterior and superior margins, 1 frag, ESS.\u000aMicro #5: Lateral margin, multiple frags, ESS.\u000aMicro #6: Tumor to anterior, posterior, and superior margins, 1 frag, ESS.\u000aMicro #7-14: Uninvolved breast parenchyma, 1 frag each, ESS.\u000apal/\u000aReports to: WINER, JOSHUA, H M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
