cal Center, One Medical Center\u000aDrive, Lebanon, NH REMOVED_DATE is a surgical pathology consultation report,\u000anumbered REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID and dated REMOVED_DATE  corresponding to three Jordan Hospital\u000aslides labeled "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID".\u000aReports to: KAELIN, CAROLYN, MARY M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: OUTSIDE SLIDE CONSULT - BREAST COMPREHENSIVE\u000a[report_end]
