EMOVED_DATE \u000aThe average of cen 17 copies per cell: REMOVED_DATE \u000aThe cutoff point for assessing HER-2/neu gene amplification is a ratio of REMOVED_DATE \u000aAddendum by Susan Lester M.D., Ph.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aAddendum #2 by Susan Lester M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000a[report_end]
