_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm), which measures REMOVED_DATE cm to the\u000ainferior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm to superior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm to the medial margin, REMOVED_DATE cm\u000ato the lateral margin, REMOVED_DATE cm to the posterior margin, and REMOVED_DATE cm to the\u000aanterior margin. The specimen is entirely submitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Superior margin, REMOVED_DATE frags per cassette, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Inferior margin, 3 frags per cassette, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Sequential sections (lesion and clip in REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID), 1 frag per\u000acassette, ESS.\u000aWCF/lp\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Xiaohua Qian M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000a2/28/2007\u000a[report_end]
