000aMicro #1 : "A" multiple frags, ESS.\u000aMicro #2 : "B" multiple frags, ESS.\u000aReports to: LOPKIN, CARL M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES)\u000a[report_end]
