E cm in aggregate).\u000aMicro 1: "A", multi frags, ESS.\u000aMicro 2: "B", multi frags, ESS.\u000aPart two, labeled "left breast mass", in a gray cassette, and consists of\u000amultiple, soft, fragmented, yellow to white tissue cores (2.3 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm\u000ain aggregate).\u000aMicro 3: Multi frags, ESS.\u000adfi\u000aReports to: SEDGWICK, EMILY M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES)\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES)\u000a[report_end]
