margin, excision (3.7 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm) performed on REMOVED_DATE \u000aaccording to the accompanying pathology report bearing the patient's name.\u000aIncluded is a consultation letter from Dr. Frederick Koerner at Massachusetts\u000aGeneral Hospital, Boston, MA; to Dr. Tad Wieczorek at Faulkner Hospital,\u000areferring to the case listed above "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", bearing the patient's name.\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Amy Ly M.D., Electronically signed on Wednesday February\u000a24, 2010 at 06:47:56PM\u000a[report_end]
