y site is REMOVED_DATE cm from the red superior\u000amargin and the overlying skin ellipse, 2 cm from the anterior blue inked\u000amargin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the inferior green inked margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the black\u000ainked deep margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the medial orange inked margin, and REMOVED_DATE cm from\u000athe lateral yellow inked margin.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  core biopsy site nearest to red inked margin, 2 frags, RSS\u000aMicro 3: core biopsy site nearest to red inked margin and skin, 1 frag,\u000aRSS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  core biopsy site nearest to orange inked margin, 2 frags, RSS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  core biopsy site nearest to green inked margin, 2 frags, RSS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  core biopsy site nearest to blue inked margin, 2 frags, RSS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  core biopsy site nearest black inked margin, 2 frags, RSS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  core biopsy site nearest to yellow inked margin, 2 frags, RSS\u000ajhl\u000aReports to: IGLEHART, JAMES, DIRK M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
