0aMicro 13: lymph node, bisected, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 14: 2 candidate lymph nodes, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro 15: 4 candidate lymph nodes, 4 frags, RSS.\u000amrk\u000aReports to: MATORY, YVEDT, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SENTINEL LYMPH NODE\u000a[report_end]
