ontains multiple, soft,\u000afragmented, yellow to white tissue cores (1.8 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm in aggregate).\u000aThe other cassette is labeled "B" and contains similar tissue fragments (1.3 x\u000a0.5 x REMOVED_DATE cm in aggregate).\u000aMicro 3: "A", multi frags, ESS.\u000aMicro 4: "B", multi frags, ESS.\u000akks\u000aReports to: MEYER, JACK, E. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES)\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES)\u000a[report_end]
