ins in these areas.\u000aAdjacent immediately to this area, is an area of yellowish discoloration (0.4 x\u000a0.3 x REMOVED_DATE cm) with adjacent hemorrhage. This area extends to within REMOVED_DATE cm of\u000athe deep margin of the specimen.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  entire specimen, lateral to medial (area of yellow discoloration\u000ain #6, 7, 8), 18 frag, ESS\u000amwb\u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
