ory:\u000aLeft breast carcinoma\u000aTissue-Designation:\u000aBreast, excision with margins - left\u000aGross description:\u000aThe specimen is received fresh, labeled "left breast mass" and consists of a\u000a52 gram, 8 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm. portion of partly yellow adipose, partly firm,\u000atan-pink tissue. A long suture marks the lateral margin, a short suture marks\u000athe superior margin, and black suture marks the medial margin. The\u000aanterior-superior margin is painted with blue ink, the anterior-inferior margin\u000ais painted with green ink, the posterior-superior margin is painted with black\u000aink, and the posterior-inferior margin is painted with yellow ink. The\u000aspecimen is serially sectioned from medial to lateral, labeled REMOVED_DATE  Cut\u000asection reveals a 4 x 1 x REMOVED_DATE cm. cavity with an irregular, partly hemorrhagic\u000ainner surface surrounded by firm yellow adipose tissue with foci of fat\u000anecrosis. 32 agg.\u000aDictated by: MJR____(signature on file)____DENNIS J. FEEN, M.D. REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a____(signature on file)____MICHAEL J. ROSS, M.D. REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a[report_end]
