e is an\u000aadditional piece of fibroadipose tissue (1.5 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm), which shows focal\u000ahemorrhage. This second specimen is inked in yellow. The entire specimen is\u000asubmitted for microscopic analysis.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Breast reexcision, multi frags, ESS.\u000aSK/mmm\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Vania Nose MD, PhD, Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000a[report_end]
