teral = yellow;\u000amedial = orange. Sections of margins are submitted for microscopic\u000aexamination. There is an area of dense white tissue extending to the inferior\u000aand posterior margins, with areas of hemorrhage measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm.\u000aThe area measures 2 x 2 x 1 cm. Adjacent towards the lateral side of the\u000aspecimen is a larger area of hemorrhage, measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm. The\u000aremainder of this specimen consists of 90% adipose tissue, yellow in color. The\u000aspecimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  tissue, right breast, multiple frags, ESS.\u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
