sed of\u000ayellow fibroadipose tissue. No discrete masses are identified. The new medial\u000amargin is inked in red, and the contralateral surface inked in black. The\u000aentire specimen, including inked margins, is submitted for histology.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  new medial margin, 1 to 2 frags per cassette, ESS.\u000aReports to: OSTEEN, ROBERT, T. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
