mpanying cytology report\u000abearing the patient's name. The cytologic preparations were not reviewed due\u000ato a lack of medical necessity (outside diagnosis: red cells/inflammatory\u000acells, scattered groupings of apocrine metaplasia cells, and scattered poorly\u000apreserved histiocytes).\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Susan Lester M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000a11/1/2006\u000a[report_end]
