fat necrosis is located 1 cm from the inferior margin and distant from\u000athe others. Representative sections are submitted for histologic analysis.\u000aMicro 4: lateral margin, 3 frags, RSS\u000aMicro 5: fibrous region with posterior and inferior margins, 1 frag, RSS\u000aMicro 6: fibrous with anterior and inferior margins, 1 frag, RSS\u000aMicro 7: superior margin, 1 frag, RSS\u000aMicro 8: medial margin, 3 frags, RSS\u000aMicro 9: second mass with inferior margin, 1 frag, RSS\u000agmw\u000aReports to: LESNIKOSKI, BETH-ANN M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: SENTINEL LYMPH NODE\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SENTINEL LYMPH NODE\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST MASTECTOMY - PARTIAL OR SIMPLE\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SENTINEL LYMPH NODE\u000a[report_end]
