d fragment of tan-yellow fibroadipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x\u000a1.0 x REMOVED_DATE cm. The specimen is entirely inked in black. Representative\u000asections of the specimen are submitted for histologic examination.\u000aMicro 20: scar, 2 frags, RSS.\u000aafn\u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SOFT TISSUE BIOPSY\u000a[report_end]
