 fresh, labeled a the patient's name, unit number, and "right breast, final shaved margin" are three tan-yellow irregular portions of breast tissue ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm, which are serially sectioned and entirely submitted as H-L. Gross Description by: LORI MARINI Resident: WEN JING, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT - REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID REPORTS TO: Barbara Lynn Smith, M.D. PART A: BREAST (RIGHT), EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B: BREAST (FINAL SHAVED MARGIN), EXCISIONAL BIOPSY\u000a[report_end]
