on in M-N. Received in formalin, labeled with the patient's name, unit number, and "final shaved superior" is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm fibrofatty tissue which has a suture designating surface furthest from the tumor, which is black inked, the opposite aspect is blue inked. The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as P. Received in formalin, labeled with the patient's name, unit number, and "final shaved inferior posterior" is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm fibrofatty tissue which has a suture designating the surface furthest from the tumor, which is black inked, the opposite aspect is blue inked. The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as Q-R. Gross Description by: LORI MARINI Resident: RESIDENT-FREE SERVICE (SGR) =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT - REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID REPORTS TO: Michele Annette Gadd, M.D. Paula Denise Ryan, M.D. Alphonse Taghian, M.D. PART A: BREAST (RIGHT), EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B: BREAST (ANTERIOR, FINAL SHAVED MARGIN), EXCISION PART C: BREAST (MEDIAL, FINAL SHAVED MARGIN), EXCISION PART D: BREAST (LATERAL, FINAL SHAVED MARGIN), EXCISION PART E: BREAST (SUPERIOR, FINAL SHAVD MARGIN), EXCISION PART F: BREAST (INFERIOR/POSTERIOR FINAL SHAVED MARGIN),EX
