 the lower inner quadrant\u000a4-8 - sections of white area with the closest margins\u000a9 - random section upper outer quadrant near 11 o'clock\u000a10 - random section lower outer quadrant near 7 o'clock\u000a11-15 - additional sections of white area and area consistent with\u000afat necrosis\u000aDictated by: RJS/NAM____(signature on file)____NICOLE MIHOK, M.D. REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a[report_end]
