ow/white lesion (0.7 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm),\u000awhich abuts the lateral, anterior, and superior margins and measures REMOVED_DATE cm to\u000athe posterior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm to the inferior margin and REMOVED_DATE cm to the medial\u000amargin. The specimen is entirely submitted for histologic examination.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Right breast tissue (lesion in REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID, REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID and REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID are one section),\u000amulti frags, ESS.\u000aWCF/mmm\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Alessandra F Nascimento M.D., Electronically signed on\u000a7/28/2006\u000a[report_end]
