 measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm. and REMOVED_DATE \u000ax REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm.\u000aSection code: REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - superior cavity edge and adjacent nipple, 5X\u000aREMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - inferior cavity, 1 agg.\u000aREMOVED_ACCESSION_ID & REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - medial cavity, 4X\u000aREMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - lateral cavity, 4 agg.\u000aUI - upper inner quadrant, 1X\u000aUO - upper outer quadrant, 1X\u000aLI - lower inner quadrant, 1X\u000aLO - lower outer quadrant, 1X\u000aSK - skin, 1X\u000aSpecimen B labeled "breast skin right" is received in formalin and consists of\u000aa REMOVED_DATE x 6 x REMOVED_DATE cm. irregular portion of skin with a smooth, tan surface. 1X\u000aTotal fixation time is 7 hours.\u000aDictated by: MJR____(signature on file)____RICHARD SAMPSON, M.D. REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a____(signature on file)____MICHAEL J. ROSS, M.D. REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a[report_end]
