en was serially sectioned from medial to\u000alateral and was entirely submitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: medial-most, 1 frag, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: serial sections, 8 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: lateral-most, 1 frag, ESS.\u000aEUB/lp\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aResident Review by Edilberto G Bauza M.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aPrelim Dx Release by Edilberto G Bauza M.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aNo Action - Prelim Sent by Eric J Burks M.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Alessandra F Nascimento M.D., Electronically signed on\u000a9/2/2005\u000a[report_end]
