lved breast parenchyma is fibrous and\u000afatty without gross lesions. The lesion abuts the black-inked surface.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Sections of breast tissue to include fibroadenoma, multi frags,\u000aRSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Breast tissue, multi frags, RSS.\u000aCASE NUMBER: BG-08-REMOVED_CASE_ID.\u000aSR/am\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by William R Welch M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000a[report_end]
