 yellow;\u000amedial = orange. On cross sectioning, an ill-defined, white/tan lesion (1.2 x\u000a0.8 x REMOVED_DATE cm) is present at inferior portion of the specimen and is located at\u000a0.1 cm from inferior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from medial margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from lateral\u000amargin, REMOVED_DATE cm from anterior margin, 1 cm from superior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from\u000adeep margin. The entire specimen is submitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  entire specimen from superior to inferior aspect, 13 frags, ESS.\u000ajis\u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
