MOVED_DATE cm from\u000athe closest superior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the closest posterior margin, and REMOVED_DATE \u000acm from the closest anterior margin. The remainder of the tissue is 99%\u000agrossly unremarkable adipose tissue. Approximately 40% of the entire specimen\u000ais submitted for histologic evaluation.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE - posterior margin, 5 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro 3 - slice posterior to clip, 1 frag, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE - slice with clip, 2 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE - slices with core biopsy, 4 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE - slices with core biopsy & anterior margin, 4 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro 12 - sections anterior to core biopsy site, 1 frag, ESS.\u000aReports to: REILLY, RAYMOND, JOHN, M.B.B.C.H.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
