ternating\u000asections from superior to inferior.\u000aPlease note that the largest portion of the cyst is present in cassette 6.\u000adl\u000aReports to: LESNIKOSKI, BETH-ANN M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
