u000a75% of the specimen is submitted for histologic analysis.\u000aMicro 1: Lateral perpendicular section, 1 frag, RSS\u000aMicro 2: Superior perpendicular section, 2 frag, RSS\u000aMicro 3: Medial perpendicular margin, 1 frag, RSS\u000aMicro 4: Inferior perpendicular margin, 3 frag, RSS\u000aMicro 5: Deep wall perpendicular margin, 1 frag, RSS\u000aMicro 6: Anterior perpendicular margin, 1 frag, RSS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Representative breast parenchyma, multi frag, RSS\u000akmb\u000aReports to: CARTER, KATHARINE M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
