: REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - entire lateral margin\u000aREMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - entire medial margin\u000aREMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - skin ellipse\u000aREMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - sections of superior edge of biopsy cavity submitted\u000afrom lateral towards medial\u000aREMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - sections of anterior portion of biopsy cavity submitted\u000afrom lateral towards medial\u000aREMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - sections of inferior biopsy cavity submitted from\u000alateral towards medial\u000aREMOVED_ACCESSION_ID - deep margin of biopsy cavity submitted from lateral\u000atowards medial\u000aDictated by: NAM____(signature on file)____DANIEL D. KOELLIKER, M.D. REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a____(signature on file)____NICOLE MIHOK, M.D. REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a[report_end]
