men is received fresh, labeled "right breast, short superior, long\u000alateral" and consists of a 520 gram, REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm. simple mastectomy\u000aspecimen with a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm. skin ellipse on one surface which has an\u000aunremarkable REMOVED_DATE cm. in diameter areola with an unremarkable REMOVED_DATE cm. in\u000adiameter nipple. The specimen is marked with a short suture at one aspect\u000aoriented as superior and 90 degrees from this at one end of the ellipse is a\u000along suture oriented as lateral of the right breast. The deep surface has a\u000asmooth surface of adipose tissue with focal attached skeletal muscle. The\u000amargins are grossly free of tumor. The skin ellipse is remarkable for a REMOVED_DATE \u000acm. in diameter, sharply demarcated, pigmented, flat lesion located REMOVED_DATE cm.\u000afrom the lateral tip of the skin ellipse. Otherwise, the skin is remarkable\u000afor a REMOVED_DATE cm. long well healed linear scar above and slightly lateral to the\u000anipple. The margins are inked. The specimen is cross sectioned. Underlying\u000athe skin in the center of the specimen, there is an 8 x 7 x REMOVED_DATE cm. cavity\u000alined by a smooth, glistening inner surface and surrounded by fat necrosis. No\u000afocal lesions are seen. Representative sections from throughout the specimen\u000aare submitted as follows:\u000aSection code: 1 - representative lateral aspect\u000a2-5 - representative sections of lateral aspect of cavity\u000a6-7 - superior aspect of cavity\u000a8-9 - superficial to cavity\u000a10-12 - deep to cavity\u000a13-15 - inferior to cavity\u000a16-18 - additional representative sections of inferior portion\u000a19-20 - medial aspect\u000a21 - nipple\u000a22 - flat pigmented area of skin\u000aDictated by: DDK____(signature on file)____MICHAEL J. ROSS, M.D. REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a____(signature on file)____DANIEL D. KOELLIKER, M.D. REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a[report_end]
