 the medial\u000amargin, and REMOVED_DATE cm from the lateral margin. Ninety (90%) percent of the\u000aspecimen is submitted from medial to lateral for microscopic evaluation.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: area of specimen containing biopsy cavity (contiguous\u000afragments every two cassettes, clip in REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID), 1 frag each,\u000aESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: lateral margin, 1 frag, RSS.\u000aDM/lp\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aResident Review by Alessandra F Nascimento M.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Alessandra F Nascimento M.D., Electronically signed on\u000a10/26/2005\u000a[report_end]
