ough\u000athe tissue reveals homogeneous yellow soft tissue. Representative sections are\u000asubmitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  medial shave margin, 1 frag each, RSS.\u000aPart five, labeled "#5, right breast inferior shave margin, stitch on new\u000amargin", consists of a single fragment of tan-pink yellow fibroadipose tissue\u000a(3.9 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm). Inked stitch is present as noted in the gross\u000adescription. The new margin is inked green, and the contralateral surface is\u000ainked black. Serial sectioning reveals heterogenous white firm fibrous tissue\u000awith interspersed yellow glistening adipose tissue. Representative sections\u000aare submitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  inferior shave margin, 3 frags each, RSS.\u000ako\u000aReports to: KAELIN, CAROLYN, MARY M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: SENTINEL LYMPH NODE\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SURGICAL MARGIN\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SURGICAL MARGIN\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SURGICAL MARGIN\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SURGICAL MARGIN\u000a[report_end]
