ow cassette, multi frags, ESS.\u000aPart B, "right breast orange cassette", in an orange cassette consists of\u000amultiple cylindrical fibrofatty cores of soft tissue (1.3 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm in\u000aaggregate) which are submitted in toto.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Multi frags, ESS.\u000aCASE NUMBER: BS-08-REMOVED_CASE_ID.\u000ajc/lp\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Susan Lester M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000a7/29/2008\u000a[report_end]
