in, REMOVED_DATE cm to the medial\u000amargin, REMOVED_DATE cm to the lateral margin, REMOVED_DATE cm to the superior margin, and REMOVED_DATE cm\u000ato the inferior margin. A second irregular, white/tan area (0.4 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE \u000acm) is located REMOVED_DATE cm to the anterior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm to the posterior margin,\u000a0.8 cm to the medial margin, REMOVED_DATE cm to the lateral margin, 2 cm to the superior\u000amargin, and REMOVED_DATE cm to the inferior margin. The clip is not found on thin\u000asections. The specimen is entirely submitted for histologic examination.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Right breast tissue, 1 frag, ESS.\u000aPart B, "additional tissue - right breast - lateral shave margin", consists of\u000afibroadipose tissue (3 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm) with one surface inked blue. No\u000adiscrete lesions are identified on cut surface. The specimen is entirely\u000asubmitted for histologic examination.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Lateral shave margin, 1 frag, ESS.\u000awcf\u005cpab\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Alessandra F Nascimento M.D., Electronically signed on\u000a8/3/2006\u000a[report_end]
