reatest dimension, located\u000a0.5 cm from superior, REMOVED_DATE cm from medial and greater than 1 cm from all other\u000amargins. Within the remainder of the breast parenchyma are scattered firm\u000aareas grossly consistent with benign changes. No other discrete masses or\u000asuspicious lesions are identified. Representative sections are submitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  cystic biopsy cavity with closest approach to superior margin,\u000aRSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  healed biopsy area with closest approach to medial (micro 3) and\u000asuperior (micro REMOVED_DATE ), RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  additional margins (note that green is posterior, and black is\u000ainferior, and anterior skin margin is uninked), multi frags, RSS.\u000afsd\u000aReports to: SOYBEL, DAVID, IRA M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST MASTECTOMY - PARTIAL OR SIMPLE\u000a[report_end]
